WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.801
-Republicans are blaming
Russia's invasion of Ukraine

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.100
on President Biden
and claiming

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.634
it wouldn't have happened
under Donald Trump,

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:09.133
while Trump muses
about bombing Russia

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:10.601
but pretending
it was someone else.

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:12.834
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.834
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:18.267
It's worth remembering,
in a moment

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:20.701
of international crisis
like the one we're in right now,

00:00:20.701 --> 00:00:22.033
that we came incredibly close

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.434
to having this criminal dingus
in charge of our response.

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:25.968
I mean, can you imagine?

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:27.267
Can you imagine what things
would be like

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:28.667
with Donald Trump
at the helm right now?

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.801
I mean,
put aside everything else,

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.367
have you heard him talk lately?

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:34.100
He sounds like he's
muttering to himself

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.167
while sitting
under his favorite tree

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.234
at the old folks' home,

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:39.501
after getting his morphine drip
topped off.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.367
-Yesterday, reporters asked me

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:43.834
if I thought President Putin
was smart.

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:47.868
I said, "Of course, he's smart,"
to which I was greeted with,

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:50.567
"Oh, that's such a terrible
thing to say."

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:52.968
I like to tell the truth.
Yes, he's smart.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:57.100
The NATO nations and,
indeed, the world

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:02.334
as he looks over
what's happening strategically,

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:06.434
with no repercussions
or threats whatsoever,

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:08.200
they're not so smart.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.367
They're looking
the opposite of smart.

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:13.501
"If you take over Ukraine,

00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:16.501
we're going to sanction you,"
they say.

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:20.501
Sanction? Well, that's
a pretty weak statement.

00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:22.968
-God, I wish I knew where his
teleprompter was during that.

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.868
What is with
that soft tone of voice?

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:34.467
Is he doing storytime
at the local library?

00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:37.501
"The pig says
'We're gonna sanction you,'

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:38.901
