a terrible thing to say.'

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.767
But do you see?
Do you see the pig?

00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:45.467
Do you see how weak he looks?"

00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:46.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.667 --> 00:01:47.968
Sometimes I wonder
what happened.

00:01:47.968 --> 00:01:51.000
