00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.667
I said, 'I know
exactly what I would do.

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:20.667
I know exactly --
I know exactly --

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:23.434
I know ex-- I know
exactly what I would do.

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:25.968
I was as anxious [Mumbling].'"

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:28.834
