00:10:23.601 --> 00:10:24.834
but he didn't succeed."

00:10:24.834 --> 00:10:27.534
-The Trump administration --
Trump personally tried

00:10:27.534 --> 00:10:29.934
to roll back sanctions on Russia
in 2017.

00:10:29.934 --> 00:10:31.601
He did.
They tried to lobby Congress

00:10:31.601 --> 00:10:34.801
to weaken Russian sanctions
and legislation in 2017.

00:10:34.801 --> 00:10:37.200
He tried to remove sanctions
on a Russian oligarch company

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.567
in 2018.
Delayed chemical-weapons

00:10:39.567 --> 00:10:41.901
sanctions that were required
by law against Russia.

00:10:41.901 --> 00:10:46.067
And let's not forget, holding
Ukrainian military aid hostage

00:10:46.067 --> 00:10:49.100
for a political stunt.
How didn't --

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:50.767
You don't think
any of those things

00:10:50.767 --> 00:10:54.400
sent a message to Vladimir Putin
that America is divided,

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.634
the West is divided, and he can
get away with whatever he wants?

00:10:59.434 --> 00:11:01.434
-You said it in every one
of those things.

00:11:01.434 --> 00:11:04.767
You kept saying, "He tried."
All I know is what he did.

00:11:04.767 --> 00:11:07.100
-"Yeah, Chuck,
he tried to help Putin,

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.100
but he was too stupid
to follow through.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.567
So, um, checkmate, libs."

00:11:11.567 --> 00:11:13.000
[ Laughter ]

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.467
I get it now --
trying is different

00:11:14.467 --> 00:11:15.901
from doing,
so it's only a crime

00:11:15.901 --> 00:11:18.801
if you successfully rob a bank,
not if you try to rob a bank

00:11:18.801 --> 00:11:20.467
but then the teller says,
"Isn't that a stapler?"

00:11:20.467 --> 00:11:22.567
and you say,
"Uh, no, uh, this is a gun."

00:11:22.567 --> 00:11:24.267
And then someone else
looks at it and says,

00:11:24.267 --> 00:11:25.667
"Office Depot
doesn't make guns,"

00:11:25.667 --> 00:11:26.901
and you say, "Shut up!"

00:11:26.901 --> 00:11:28.334
So then you try to steal a pen
without realizing

00:11:28.334 --> 00:11:30.133
the pen is chained to the desk,
so you get yanked

00:11:30.133 --> 00:11:31.834
and you fall backwards
and you split your pants,

00:11:31.834 --> 00:11:33.067
and everyone at the bank
starts laughing.

00:11:33.067 --> 00:11:35.234
You're sweating so bad,
you take off your mask

00:11:35.234 --> 00:11:37.167
and someone says,
"There's a camera, you idiot."

00:11:37.167 --> 00:11:38.634
And you look up and you realize

00:11:38.634 --> 00:11:39.868
you're staring straight into
the security camera,

00:11:39.868 --> 00:11:41.834
and you say, "Guys,
this doesn't count, okay?

00:11:41.834 --> 00:11:44.067
I only tried to rob the bank,
but I didn't do it, so shut up."

00:11:44.067 --> 00:11:46.167
And then the video gets uploaded
to YouTube, and it goes viral.

00:11:46.167 --> 00:11:47.901
So, to stop it,
you file a lawsuit against...

00:11:47.901 --> 00:11:49.501
-All machines.
-Yeah.

00:11:49.501 --> 00:11:52.667
[ Laughter ]
All -- Every one.

00:11:52.667 --> 00:11:54.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:54.167 --> 00:11:57.434
The point is, if you're a person
with any power at all,

00:11:57.434 --> 00:11:59.100
and you want to do something
about the crisis,

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:01.300
maybe try helping
the 1.7 million refugees

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:02.968
who have fled Ukraine so far,

00:12:02.968 --> 00:12:04.367
the many others
who are still there

00:12:04.367 --> 00:12:05.534
and need our solidarity.

00:12:05.534 --> 00:12:07.567
That would be
a lot more productive

00:12:07.567 --> 00:12:09.868
than pitching insane ideas
for starting World War III.

00:12:09.868 --> 00:12:11.200
No one wants to hear that.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.300
Even the people at your
fundraisers are thinking...

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.801
-"Oh, that's such a terrible
thing to say."

00:12:15.801 --> 00:12:17.801
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:17.801 --> 00:12:20.834
[ Theme music plays ]

00:12:20.834 --> 00:12:22.267
God's Love We Deliver

00:12:22.267 --> 00:12:24.133
cooks and brings
over 2 million meals a year

00:12:24.133 --> 00:12:26.567
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,

00:12:26.567 --> 00:12:27.767
and other serious illnesses,

00:12:27.767 --> 00:12:29.734
and they need your help now
more than ever.

00:12:29.734 --> 00:12:31.901
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:12:31.901 --> 00:12:34.467
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

